        "original_id": "7fa8e12a-28ac-5c4c-9175-73ad62548b6f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: PDQ Chocolate, Ovaltine\n- Companies: Associated British Foods, Wander AG, Twinings, Novartis, Nestlé\n\nFacts:\n- PDQ Chocolate was a popular drink mix in the 1960s and 1970s.\n- PDQ Chocolate was manufactured by Ovaltine.\n- In 2002, Twinings acquired the Ovaltine brand from Novartis.\n- Ovaltine is a registered trademark of Associated British Foods.\n- Ovaltine is made by Wander AG, which is a subsidiary of Twinings.\n- In the United States, Nestlé later acquired Ovaltine rights separately from Novartis.",
